5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"Hello everyone. Since our current habits are no longer working, we should establish a sustainable system. I believe we need a clear understanding of the costs and the actual time required before we decide.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"I agree. We should avoid making a decision based on vague impressions. To build a system that actually lasts, we need to analyze the objective data regarding the workload and the financial implications.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,It seems we are all in a remarkably pragmatic mood today. I quite agree; a touch of logic now will save us from a great deal of theatrical arguing later. Let us see what the evidence suggests.,"{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,"I'm looking forward to this! Let's just make sure we don't get so bogged down in ""objective data"" that we forget to make the plan actually livable. I'm ready to dive in!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,It's nice to meet you all. I agree that harmony is the most important thing here. I hope we can find a way to keep our home peaceful and happy for everyone.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"To ensure we have a precise financial picture, I will look into the ""Management office rate sheet and billing"" and the ""Bathroom spray stock and the tin's receipts."" We must know exactly what we are spending.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I will examine the ""Stopwatch timing of a full pass"" and the ""Standard terms of the outside firm."" I want to determine the actual time commitment required and if outsourcing is a viable way to reduce the burden.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I shall investigate ""A fortnight's watch on kitchen use"" and ""Absences on the wall calendar."" It would be a pity to design a system of equality that ignores the actual reality of who is inhabiting the space.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"I'll check ""What each housemate counts as done"" and ""Rows recorded in the house chat""! I want to see where we're clashing and why some of us think a room is clean while others don't!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,"I'll look into the ""Note left by the previous tenants"" and ""Rows recorded in the house chat."" I want to see if there are any recurring problems we can avoid to keep things friendly.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"It seems we have a comprehensive distribution of research. By covering the financial, temporal, and social aspects, we can avoid any blind spots in our final arrangement. I will wait for the results.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. Dividing the research this way ensures we address both the logistical constraints and the interpersonal friction. I will focus on the actual hours involved to ensure the workload is sustainable.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A most efficient division of labor. While some of us hunt for pennies and seconds, I shall be contemplating the curious intersection of presence and productivity. I look forward to our findings.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,"@Benjamin, ""contemplating the intersection"" sounds very fancy! I'll just be looking for the juicy drama in the chat. Let's hope we find some clues that actually help us stop the guessing game!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,"I'm glad we're all so motivated! I hope that by understanding the past, we can create a future where everyone feels comfortable and appreciated. I'll do my best with my research!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I agree. Let us proceed with the research and reconvene once the data is available. I will be interested to see if the actual expenditures align with our perceived costs.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,1,4,pass,Toshio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. Let us gather the facts first. I will focus on the time requirements and the feasibility of professional services to ensure we don't commit to an unsustainable workload. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
23,1,4,pass,Ryuji,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I shall retire to my studies then. I trust the data will be more illuminating than our current state of domestic chaos. Until we meet again to piece together this puzzle.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,1,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,1,4,talk,May,,I'm off to find the secrets of the house chat! I'll see you all soon with the results. Let's hope we can actually agree on something without it becoming a soap opera! Bye-bye!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,1,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,1,4,talk,Midori,,I'll go and see what I can find out now. I really hope we can find a solution that keeps us all on good terms. See you all soon!,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
